1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,368
And through all five of those years, the public never knew she existed.

2
00:00:04,368 --> 00:00:05,773
No survival show.

3
00:00:05,773 --> 00:00:06,971
No rumor mill.

4
00:00:06,971 --> 00:00:10,798
Just a locked file inside a company famous for locked files.

5
00:00:10,798 --> 00:00:20,025
It is one of the strangest quirks of this story: K-pop's most anticipated debut of the decade belonged to a girl whose name had never once trended.

